### 로그 수집 API 요청 예시 (클라이언트 로그 명세 v0.6)
### userId·runId는 실제 클라처럼 부호 있는 64비트 값이다.


### 1. 게임 실행 — runId/floor/round 없는 이벤트 (해당 컬럼이 NULL로 저장되는지)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "userId": 2208189609186332156,
    "eventType": "ACCOUNT_LOGIN",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:39:50.957Z",
    "difficulty": "Standard",
    "payload": { "platform": "PC", "clientVersion": "1.0", "region": "KR" }
  }
]


### 2. 판 시작 — 클라는 이렇게 여러 건을 배열로 묶어 보낸다 (최대 20건)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "userId": 2208189609186332156,
    "eventType": "RUN_START",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:17:13.217Z",
    "difficulty": "Limited",
    "runId": -1122512345824004122,
    "payload": { "attackType": "SPECIAL_SHOT", "clientVersion": "1.0" }
  },
  {
    "userId": 2208189609186332156,
    "eventType": "FLOOR_ENTER",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:17:13.218Z",
    "difficulty": "Limited",
    "runId": -1122512345824004122,
    "floor": 1,
    "round": "1",
    "payload": { "fieldCount": 4, "hasBoss": true }
  },
  {
    "userId": 2208189609186332156,
    "eventType": "ROUND_ENTER",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:17:13.220Z",
    "difficulty": "Limited",
    "runId": -1122512345824004122,
    "floor": 1,
    "round": "1",
    "payload": {
      "mapId": "F1_3",
      "elapsedMs": 0,
      "overclockDeciseconds": 0,
      "currency": { "basic": 0, "timeStop": 0 }
    }
  }
]


### 3. 스테이지 클리어 — 상점을 나와 Save될 때 나간다. 값은 클리어한 순간의 것
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "userId": 2208189609186332156,
    "eventType": "ROUND_CLEAR",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:18:09.000Z",
    "difficulty": "Limited",
    "runId": -1122512345824004122,
    "floor": 1,
    "round": "1",
    "payload": {
      "clearElapsedMs": 40920,
      "clearOverclockDeciseconds": 878,
      "clearCurrency": { "basic": 5, "timeStop": 2 },
      "build": {
        "weapons": [],
        "runes": [],
        "augments": [ { "augmentId": 8, "stacks": 1 } ]
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "userId": 2208189609186332156,
    "eventType": "ROUND_ENTER",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:18:58.309Z",
    "difficulty": "Limited",
    "runId": -1122512345824004122,
    "floor": 1,
    "round": "2",
    "payload": {
      "mapId": "F1_4",
      "elapsedMs": 43659,
      "overclockDeciseconds": 898,
      "currency": { "basic": 1, "timeStop": 2 }
    }
  }
]


### 4. 사망 — PLAYER_DEATH 바로 뒤에 RUN_END(DEATH). killerId는 문자열
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "userId": 2208189609186332156,
    "eventType": "PLAYER_DEATH",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:58:01.047Z",
    "difficulty": "Limited",
    "runId": -1122512345824004122,
    "floor": 1,
    "round": "2",
    "payload": {
      "deathCause": "HAZARD",
      "killerId": "RESIDUAL_BEAM",
      "elapsedMs": 18679,
      "build": {
        "weapons": [],
        "runes": [],
        "augments": [ { "augmentId": 10, "stacks": 1 }, { "augmentId": 5, "stacks": 1 } ]
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "userId": 2208189609186332156,
    "eventType": "RUN_END",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:58:01.048Z",
    "difficulty": "Limited",
    "runId": -1122512345824004122,
    "floor": 1,
    "round": "2",
    "payload": {
      "result": "DEATH",
      "elapsedMs": 18679,
      "overclockDeciseconds": 0,
      "build": {
        "weapons": [],
        "runes": [],
        "augments": [ { "augmentId": 10, "stacks": 1 }, { "augmentId": 5, "stacks": 1 } ]
      }
    }
  }
]
